ut is header-only and provides the CMake target ut::ut:

  find_package(ut CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(my_tests PRIVATE ut::ut)

The tests then use:

  #include "ut/ut.hpp"

  using namespace ut;

  suite tests = [] {
    "a test"_test = [] {
      expect(1 + 1 == 2) << "arithmetic is broken";
    };
  };

  int main() {}
